OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer dragged in road during
OL,4,Aarrest attempt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fattempted wounding and possession of
OL,8,FClass A drugs, after a police officer
OL,9,Fwas dragged by a vehicle while trying
OL,10,Fto intervene during a suspected drug
OL,11,Fdeal.
OL,13,FIt happened on James Nelson Way in
OL,14,FNelson, just north of Burnley, at about
OL,15,F22:20 BST on 17 October, Lancashire
OL,16,FPolice said.
OL,18,FAs the constable attempted to arrest
OL,19,Fthe driver of a Renault Megane, the
OL,20,Fsuspect reversed the vehicle in an
OL,21,Feffort to escape, dragging the officer
OL,22,Fand throwing him into the road.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
